# Force LF line endings for all site source files, regardless of platform
# or editor settings. This matters beyond style: the AI editor's find/replace
# guard does exact string matching, and every LLM writes plain LF in its
# output - a CRLF file makes every multi-line edit fail to match, silently,
# no matter which model is used. See _worker.js's normalizeLineEndings().
* text=auto eol=lf
